description:
Define the types used by DnsAuthCache (renamed from DkimKeyCache).

File: crates/transit/src/dns_auth_cache.rs (renamed from dkim_cache.rs)
Also add pub mod dns_auth_cache to lib.rs.

```rust
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]
pub enum EvidenceType {
    Dkim,
    Spf,
    Dmarc,
    Arc,
}
impl EvidenceType {
    pub fn as_str(&self) -> &'static str { ... }
    pub fn from_str(s: &str) -> Option<Self> { ... }
}

#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq, Eq)]
pub enum RecordStatus {
    Active,
    Rotated,   // was present, now gone from DNS
    Revoked,   // present with empty p= (DKIM revocation)
}
impl RecordStatus {
    pub fn as_str(&self) -> &'static str { ... }
    pub fn from_str(s: &str) -> Option<Self> { ... }
}

#[derive(Debug, Clone)]
pub struct DnsAuthRecord {
    pub evidence_type: EvidenceType,
    pub domain: String,
    pub selector: String,        // empty for SPF/DMARC
    pub record_cid: String,      // empty for tombstone
    pub first_seen_ms: i64,
    pub last_seen_ms: i64,
    pub ttl_secs: Option<i64>,
    pub algorithm: Option<String>,  // DKIM/ARC only
    pub key_bytes: Option<Vec<u8>>, // DKIM/ARC only
    pub policy: Option<String>,     // SPF/DMARC raw policy string
    pub record_status: RecordStatus,
}
```

No DB access — pure type definitions.
Defensive rules: all from_str return None for unknown variants.
